[2026-09-14T19:39:10.432Z] • A unit's purpose may be to act as a helper for some other unit which has
[2026-09-14T19:39:10.432Z]   a requirement dependency on it.
[2026-09-14T19:39:10.432Z] • A unit may be started when needed via activation (socket, path, timer,
